{"v":4,"catch":"某樂團的音樂化身為刺激的動作冒險遊戲！","desc":"Tyraels Ascension: Hell Walker - The Video Game，是一款緊湊的動作冒險遊戲，融合輕度角色扮演元素，核心玩法包含頭目戰鬥、探索升級、可重複遊玩的關卡、鑰匙收集以及眾多隱藏祕密。\n本遊戲以金屬核樂團「Tyraels Ascension」音樂為基礎，由樂團成員親自創作，故事背景設定為樂團專輯《Hell Walker》的前傳篇章。\n盡情享受專輯曲目轉化為「芯片音樂」版本的獨特音效，以天使般的狂怒貫穿戰鬥全程。\n\n此遊戲是由Maker系列中專門製作動作遊戲的軟體「Pixel Game Maker MV」所製作。此遊戲系列均能在Nintendo Switch™上遊玩。","publisher":"Gotcha Gotcha Games","release":"2025-10-23","genres":["街機","動作","角色扮演"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"輔15歳級","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/00e10e8da419dbae0c33705696693a5f1ce06ab5f35bc297d8d36fa42d0232a8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2720d461fd1314b0d49434702f0b1501522afb2b90fd2e5bcaa7d06282cf287a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e154a81f8369f180d3bd60341288a3995095109fbc3ab6aca5be20da9ef91d8e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/bcd2596132526722c6a4b661551dd25f074c08800acf0e32c83f6f8f40d3c35c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0001f34c8e21a21b8e54d73a445f744b544958b12a9d75a34d0191aac112b01e.jpg"],"titleId":"0100992023b50000","dlc":[],"vids":["mk0tkpr4GsU"]}